ge your innovation and creativity. Discover how trademarks, designs, copyright and other IP rights can help protect your brand, strengthen your valuation and provide you opportunities to scale. 🚀","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T13:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T13:25:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"f27b2b4f-bd9d-46f8-af42-8370df6f6982","name":"Meetup 2","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Meetup","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"21b6ba3f-f5cb-4ede-912a-783a583e1a0e","slug":"france-meetup","title":"🇫🇷 France meetup","description":"A space for the French to connect at Web Summit. Meet each other, exchange ideas, and mingle with people who get where you're from. See you there 👋\n\nUn espace pensé pour les Français au Web Summit. Rencontrez-vous, échangez des idées et socialisez avec des personnes du même pays. À bientôt sur place ! 👋","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T13:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T13:55:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"fc9cbd2c-9453-41b6-be58-a5129b35116a","name":"Meetup 4","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Meetup","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"b1f8d8b0-19fb-4a7e-8755-20a8bbc5c2f9","slug":"can-bessent-beat-the-bond-market","title":"Can Bessent beat the bond market?","description":"Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent wants lower interest rates, but the bond market has so far refused to cooperate. This talk explores the growing tension between Washington’s fiscal ambitions and the investors who ultimately determine the cost of U.S. borrowing. Can Bessent beat the bond markets, or will rising yields, mounting debt and inflation force a reckoning? And, if he loses, what does that mean for the dollar’s status as the world’s reserve currency?","date":"November 12","star